second artist, birth date for a different person, or second sport is evidence to retain it. Check each proposed deletion once more against all originals before producing the final short list.\nInput: {\"question\": \"In which significant event was Church of the Good Shepherd Episcopal involved?\", \"slot_hint\": \"other\", \"all_original_sources\": {\"D1S1\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 123, \"text\": \"**HEADLINE:** Terrell's Church of the Good Shepherd Episcopal Makes History with Unprecedented Display of Community Consent\"}, \"D1S2\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 125, \"end\": 256, \"text\": \"**TERRELL, TEXAS -** In a remarkable display of unity and cooperation, the Church of the Good Shepherd Episcopal, located at 200 W.\"}, \"D1S3\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 257, \"end\": 411, \"text\": \"College St., has made headlines by becoming the first religious institution in the state to achieve 100% community consent for a major renovation project.\"}, \"D1S4\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 412, \"end\": 526, \"text\": \"The historic church, a staple of Terrell's downtown area, has been a hub of community activity for over a century.\"}, \"D1S5\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 527, \"end\": 610, \"text\": \"However, as the congregation grew, so did the need for expansion and modernization.\"}, \"D1S6\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 611, \"end\": 789, \"text\": \"In response, the church leadership proposed a comprehensive renovation plan, which included the addition of new facilities, improved accessibility, and energy-efficient upgrades.\"}, \"D1S7\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 790, \"end\": 962, \"text\": \"What sets this project apart is the church's commitment to obtaining explicit consent from every single member of the community, a feat that has never been achieved before.\"}, \"D1S8\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 963, \"end\": 980, \"text\": \"According to Rev.\"}, \"D1S9\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 981, \"end\": 1128, \"text\": \"Emily Wilson, Rector of the Church of the Good Shepherd Episcopal, \\\"We wanted to ensure that every voice was heard and every concern was addressed.\"}, \"D1S10\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1129, \"end\": 1257, \"text\": \"We believe that this project belongs to the entire community, and we wanted to make sure everyone felt invested in its success.\\\"\"}, \"D1S11\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1258, \"end\": 1388, \"text\": \"The consent process, which spanned several months, involved a series of town hall meetings, surveys, and one-on-one consultations.\"}, \"D1S12\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1389, \"end\": 1561, \"text\": \"Church members and local residents were encouraged to share their thoughts, concerns, and suggestions, which were carefully documented and incorporated into the final plan.\"}, \"D1S13\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1562, \"end\": 1704, \"text\": \"\\\"I was blown away by the level of engagement and enthusiasm from the community,\\\" said Karen Thompson, a long-time church member and volunteer.\"}, \"D1S14\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1705, \"end\": 1815, \"text\": \"\\\"It was amazing to see people from all walks of life come together to shape the future of our beloved church.\\\"\"}, \"D1S15\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1816, \"end\": 1954, \"text\": \"The data speaks for itself: out of a total of 1,200 community members surveyed, 100% provided explicit consent for the renovation project.\"}, \"D1S16\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1955, \"end\": 2090, \"text\": \"This unprecedented level of agreement is a testament to the church's dedication to transparency, inclusivity, and community engagement.\"}, \"D1S17\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 2091, \"end\": 2268, \"text\": \"The renovation project, which is expected to be completed within the next 18 months, will not only enhance the church's facilities but also provide a boost to the local economy.\"}, \"D1S18\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 2269, \"end\": 2429, \"text\": \"According to a study by the Terrell Chamber of Commerce, the project is expected to generate over $1 million in economic activity and create dozens of new jobs.\"}, \"D1S19\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 2430, \"end\": 2614, \"text\": \"As the Church of the Good Shepherd Episcopal embarks on this exciting new chapter, its commitment to community consent serves as a beacon of hope and cooperation for the entire region.\"}, \"D1S20\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 2615, \"end\": 2622, \"text\": \"As Rev.\"}, \"D2S1\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 83, \"text\": \"Title: The Pillar of Faith: Church of the Good Shepherd Episcopal's Enduring Legacy\"}, \"D2S2\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 85, \"end\": 219, \"text\": \"In the heart of Terrell, Texas, a beacon of hope and spirituality stands tall, a testament to the power of community and perseverance.\"}, \"D2S3\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 220, \"end\": 281, \"text\": \"The Church of the Good Shepherd Episcopal, situated at 200 W.\"}, \"D2S4\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 282, \"end\": 355, \"text\": \"College St., has been a cornerstone of the city's fabric for generations.\"}, \"D2S5\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 356, \"end\": 470, \"text\": \"Behind its elegant façade lies a rich history, woven from the threads of faith, dedication, and economic activity.\"}, \"D2S6\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 471, \"end\": 610, \"text\": \"This narrative delves into the significant event of construction that shaped the church's identity and cemented its place in the community.\"}, \"D2S7\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 611, \"end\": 773, \"text\": \"The year was 1885, and Terrell was a burgeoning town, its population swelling with settlers drawn to the area's fertile soil and promising economic opportunities.\"}, \"D2S8\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 774, \"end\": 920, \"text\": \"As the town grew, so did the need for a spiritual hub, a place where residents could come together to worship, find solace, and forge connections.\"}, \"D2S9\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 921, \"end\": 1006, \"text\": \"It was against this backdrop that the Church of the Good Shepherd Episcopal was born.\"}, \"D2S10\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1007, \"end\": 1126, \"text\": \"The construction of the church was a monumental undertaking, one that required the collective efforts of the community.\"}, \"D2S11\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1127, \"end\": 1224, \"text\": \"Parishioners, local businessmen, and skilled craftsmen joined forces to bring the vision to life.\"}, \"D2S12\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1225, \"end\": 1369, \"text\": \"The project was a significant economic activity, injecting life into the local economy and creating jobs for laborers, carpenters, and artisans.\"}, \"D2S13\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1370, \"end\": 1492, \"text\": \"As the church began to take shape, it became a symbol of hope and progress, a beacon of light in a rapidly changing world.\"}, \"D2S14\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1493, \"end\": 1561, \"text\": \"The church's design was a masterclass in elegance and functionality.\"}, \"D2S15\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1562, \"end\": 1720, \"text\": \"The Gothic Revival style, popular during the late 19th century, was chosen for its soaring vertical lines, pointed arches, and stunning stained-glass windows.\"}, \"D2S16\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1721, \"end\": 1845, \"text\": \"The building's façade, constructed from locally sourced limestone, was a testament to the region's rich geological heritage.\"}, \"D2S17\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1846, \"end\": 2020, \"text\": \"The attention to detail was meticulous, from the intricately carved wooden pews to the majestic bell tower, which would soon become a beloved landmark in the Terrell skyline.\"}, \"D2S18\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 2021, \"end\": 2150, \"text\": \"As the construction progressed, the church became a hub of activity, with townspeople gathering to watch the building take shape.\"}, \"D2S19\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 2151, \"end\": 2320, \"text\": \"The sound of hammers ringing out, the smell of freshly cut wood, and the sight of workers hauling heavy stones into place created a sense of excitement and anticipation.\"}, \"D2S20\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 2321, \"end\": 2485, \"text\": \"The church was more than just a building; it was a symbol of community, a testament to the power of collective effort, and a beacon of hope for generations to come.\"}}, \"original_cards\": [], \"R5_answers\": [\"renovation project with 100% community consent\"], \"candidates\": [{\"id\": \"C0\", \"answer\": \"renovation project with 100% community consent\", \"origin\": \"R5\"}, {\"id\": \"C1\", \"answer\": \"construction in 1885 as a spiritual hub\", \"origin\": \"proposal\"}]}"
      }
